	- Do not return to the user. Think for as long as you like and work for as long as you like (until I explicitly interrupt you), just make sure to update the notebook `git commit` on visible research checkpoints. But **do not return to the user** -- I will not be present to reprompt you.
	- rinse and repeat

	Rules clear? GO.
